Value Required peer_ip ([0-9a-fA-F:.]+)
Value Required peer_asn (\d+)
Value description (.+?)
Value state (\w+)
Value uptime (\S+)
Value prefixes_received (\d+)
Value prefixes_accepted (\d+)

Start
  ^\w+\s+BGP\s+\S+\s+${state}\s+${uptime}
  ^\s+Description:\s+${description}
  ^\s+Neighbor address:\s+${peer_ip}
  ^\s+Neighbor AS:\s+${peer_asn}
  ^\s+Routes:\s+${prefixes_received} imported,\s+${prefixes_accepted} accepted -> Record
  ^\s+Routes:\s+${prefixes_received} imported,\s+any\s+accepted -> Record
